        },
        {
          "text": "Amagufa ga Yosefu Abaisirairi aga baihire Misiri bakagaziika Sekemu omwitaka Yakobbo eri yaguzireho Hamora ise Sekemu; eriyaheeriire ebicweeka kikumi by'efeeza; lyafookera kimu itaka ly'abaijukuru ba Yosefu.",
          "type": "text",
