              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Hanyuma, Eryeza mutabani wa Arooni, na uwe yafa, baamuziika omu Gibeha, orubuga orwa mutabani we Finehaasi, orubakaba bamuhaire omunsi ey'ensozi ey'Efuraimu.",
          "type": "text",
